[en.IDEA_C12_CLOUD_CITY_AGREEMENT_2]
Cloud City agreement

[en.IDEA_C12_CLOUD_CITY_AGREEMENT_2_desc]
We’ve signed an agreement with Cloud City. We provide them with some of the food they need, and in exchange, some of Cloud City’s pegasi are allowed to join our air force as instructors and mercenaries.

[zh.IDEA_C12_CLOUD_CITY_AGREEMENT_2]
云中城协议

[zh.IDEA_C12_CLOUD_CITY_AGREEMENT_2_desc]
我们与云中城签订了协议，我们提供给云中城一部分所需的食物，而作为交换，一些云中城的天马则被允许以教官和雇佣兵的身份加入我们的空军部队。
